From 685d23944eb26aa75e0695c5f397cf79857ea14f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NikoMalik <NikoMalik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:34:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] zram:  zram branch and port lz4kdr

separate compression and decompression streams,rw_semaphore for decompression,singleton recompression context,zstd memory fixes and bugfixes
lz4kdr backend moved to create_cctx/destroy_cctx,decompression is stateless so no dctx

---
 drivers/block/zram/backend_842.c     |  14 +-
 drivers/block/zram/backend_deflate.c | 113 +++++---
 drivers/block/zram/backend_lz4.c     |  93 ++----
 drivers/block/zram/backend_lz4hc.c   | 119 ++++----
 drivers/block/zram/backend_lz4kdr.c  |  30 +-
 drivers/block/zram/backend_lzo.c     |  14 +-
 drivers/block/zram/backend_lzorle.c  |  14 +-
 drivers/block/zram/backend_zstd.c    | 142 ++++++----
 drivers/block/zram/zcomp.c           | 235 +++++++++++++---
 drivers/block/zram/zcomp.h           |  47 +++-
 drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c        | 406 +++++++++++++++------------
 drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.h        |   1 +
 12 files changed, 762 insertions(+), 466 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/block/zram/backend_842.c b/drivers/block/zram/backend_842.c
